</div>
<div class="Section" data-sectioncode="42229-5">
<a name="ID_2e06df75-b43f-40bc-8723-9bbcc187fefd"></a><a name="section-2.2"></a>
<p></p>
<h2>2.2 Pediatric Dosing Information </h2>
<p class="First">Xyrem is administered orally twice nightly. The recommended starting pediatric dosage, titration regimen, and maximum total nightly dosage are based on patient weight, as specified in Table 2. The dosage may be gradually titrated based on efficacy and tolerability.</p>
<p>
<span class="Bold">Table 2: Recommended Pediatric Xyrem Dosage for Patients 7 Years of Age and Older*</span>
